  "captions": {
    "controls": "Full3D independent scikit-fem P2 shell versus Lam\u00e9, and supported deformable-block IPC controls. Dashed lines show the initially declared3% target. Red crosses at the activation-distance axis mark failed solves with no accepted error value. Contact force/peak errors use0.5N/5000Pa analytic zero-gap values.",
